|---|---------|------|------------|
| 1 | Delhi-NCR Boundary | [delhi_ncr_region.geojson](file:///K:/Summer%20Internship/earth-observation-delhi-airshed/data/delhi_ncr_region.geojson) | Administrative boundary of Delhi-NCR (multiple districts as polygons) |
| 2 | Sentinel-2 RGB Patches | `rgb/` folder (9216 PNGs) | 128×128 pixel satellite images at 10m resolution. Filename = `lat_lon.png` |
| 3 | Delhi Airshed | [delhi_airshed.geojson](file:///K:/Summer%20Internship/earth-observation-delhi-airshed/data/delhi_airshed.geojson) | Rectangular bounding box (~60×80 km) covering air quality monitoring region |
| 4 | ESA WorldCover 2021 | [worldcover_bbox_delhi_ncr_2021.tif](file:///K:/Summer%20Internship/earth-observation-delhi-airshed/data/worldcover_bbox_delhi_ncr_2021.tif) | Land cover classification raster (10m resolution), each pixel = a class code |

